  category: Boss Abilities
  title: Spawn Obstacles
  description: The boss will spawn multiple obstacles on the board. They can be spawned
    individually scattered across the board or in patterns of 2x2, 1x4, or 4x1. This
    ability only spawns stone obstacles.
